<section
  class="step-panel"
  id="panel-1"
  role="tabpanel"
  aria-labelledby="tab-1"
  data-panel-step="1"
  <%= boot.step !== 1 ? 'hidden' : '' %>
>
  <div class="panel-head">
    <span class="eyebrow">Step 1</span>
    <h2>Kirim Magic Link</h2>
    <p>Masukkan email yang ingin diaktifkan. Sistem akan mengirim link verifikasi resmi Alight Motion ke inbox tersebut.</p>
  </div>

  <form id="magic-form" class="form" novalidate>
    <div class="field">
      <label for="email">Alamat email</label>
      <input
        id="email"
        name="email"
        type="email"
        inputmode="email"
        autocomplete="email"
        spellcheck="false"
        maxlength="254"
        placeholder="nama@email.com"
        value="<%= boot.email %>"
        required
        aria-describedby="email-hint"
      >
      <p class="hint" id="email-hint">Gunakan email aktif. Link dikirim ke inbox email ini.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="hp-field" aria-hidden="true">
      <label for="hp-magic">Jangan diisi</label>
      <input id="hp-magic" name="hp" type="text" tabindex="-1" autocomplete="off">
    </div>

    <div class="captcha-wrap" data-captcha="magic" <%= boot.captchaEnabled ? '' : 'hidden' %>>
      <div id="turnstile-magic" class="turnstile" data-sitekey="<%= boot.turnstileSiteKey %>"></div>
    </div>

    <button class="btn btn-primary btn-block" id="magic-submit" type="submit">
      <span class="btn-label">Kirim Magic Link</span>
    </button>

    <p class="status" id="magic-status" role="status" aria-live="polite"></p>
  </form>

  <div class="panel-note">
    <strong>Belum menerima email?</strong>
    <span>Tunggu 1-2 menit, lalu cek folder spam atau promosi. Tombol kirim ulang aktif setelah 60 detik.</span>
  </div>
</section>
